# GludioStand (35079; GludioBowGuardStand binds its own ids), the standing guards of the Aden siege (clan
# aden_siege_clan, 300): a guard that sees the character wants to attack it holding its ground
# (200); a hit of 22, a twentieth of its fixture hit points, adds 100 from its attacked hook and 100
# from its clan-attacked one (the call reaches the guard itself), held as well.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioStand.GludioBowGuardStand
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioStand.GludioStand
npc stand 35079 SiegeGuard 150 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300

approach stand
  desires stand attack(player,hold)=200
hit stand 22
  desires stand attack(player,hold)=400
